                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "686046d3-32c0-4f5d-b10c-dc73ddb1635c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9caf764c-3645-3a4d-bdfa-419ea2c50970",
                        "source_sense_id": "e06baadf-7edb-348c-855d-4154e93ad7c4",
                        "source_sense_description": "ontdekking, uitvinding",
                        "target_lang_word": "invention",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "invention",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2465b6ba-43a8-3a08-8461-2d68df4c1677",
                                        "entry_id": "081a88a0-95af-3d71-a494-40986238ea4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something invented."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dde050ea-6a27-44b4-82bc-dc851f9d177c",
                                                "sense_id": "2465b6ba-43a8-3a08-8461-2d68df4c1677",
                                                "text": "My new invention will let you alphabetize your matchbook collection in half the usual time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf3441ba-1507-4cce-bd01-f64c2aa337ad",
                                                "sense_id": "2465b6ba-43a8-3a08-8461-2d68df4c1677",
                                                "text": "I’m afraid there was no burglar. It was all the housekeeper’s invention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed12d51b-4947-4fdc-ac67-92d5cc9a7a9c",
                                                "sense_id": "2465b6ba-43a8-3a08-8461-2d68df4c1677",
                                                "text": "Warren Sheffield is telephoning Rose long distance at half past six. […] Personally, I wouldn't marry a man who proposed to me over an invention."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ceadff5-daed-409a-8da1-569b3290ce8f",
                                                "sense_id": "2465b6ba-43a8-3a08-8461-2d68df4c1677",
                                                "text": "British inventions have done more to influence the shape of the modern world than those of any other country. Many—football, the steam engine and Worcestershire sauce, to take a random selection—have spread pleasure, goodwill and prosperity. Others—the Maxim gun, the Shrapnel shell and jellied eels—have not."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4157f012-ed87-33e7-b19b-1dffb96db73c",
                                        "entry_id": "081a88a0-95af-3d71-a494-40986238ea4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of inventing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33a6da87-6ab3-4923-98b2-489cf7ae8adb",
                                                "sense_id": "4157f012-ed87-33e7-b19b-1dffb96db73c",
                                                "text": "The invention of the printing press was probably the most significant innovation of the medieval ages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3795ae6d-65d0-4d1a-ab2c-ff18847e7e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "4157f012-ed87-33e7-b19b-1dffb96db73c",
                                                "text": "Invention, or the Genius of Hiſtoricizing and framing a Noble Idea upon the Subject one vvould Paint, is a particular Talent, not to be acquir'd by Study or Labour; but is properly a certain ardor exciting the Imagination, prompting and enabling it to Act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92ac85b6-06ed-4812-9f1c-211615744ed3",
                                                "sense_id": "4157f012-ed87-33e7-b19b-1dffb96db73c",
                                                "text": "Digging deeper, the invention of eyeglasses is an elaboration of the more fundamental development of optics technology. The ability of a segment of a glass sphere to magnify whatever is placed before it was known around the year 1000, when the spherical segment was called a reading stone,[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b4a1190-f13d-340b-91bc-7e579c31d70e",
                                        "entry_id": "081a88a0-95af-3d71-a494-40986238ea4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The capacity to invent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cfaa339-b4cf-4a43-8dad-6ebb67bc7b78",
                                                "sense_id": "7b4a1190-f13d-340b-91bc-7e579c31d70e",
                                                "text": "It took quite a bit of invention to come up with a plan, but we did it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "feddfe37-27a4-34a2-8093-a993b2d86cec",
                                        "entry_id": "081a88a0-95af-3d71-a494-40986238ea4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small, self-contained composition, particularly those in J.S. Bach’s Two- and Three-part Inventions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1dde1b7-cc9d-4f71-ac0b-0cd8d95c0d77",
                                                "sense_id": "feddfe37-27a4-34a2-8093-a993b2d86cec",
                                                "text": "I particularly like the inventions in C-minor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ec1467f-e24e-4ba3-bc24-32c55f4cb843",
                                                "sense_id": "feddfe37-27a4-34a2-8093-a993b2d86cec",
                                                "text": "INVENTION. A term used by J. S. Bach, and probably by him only, for small pianoforte pieces — 15 in 2 parts and 15 in 3 parts — each developing a single idea, and in some measure answering to the Impromptu of a later day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95b6afa1-ec69-3e22-976c-5cd4f3bca8b1",
                                        "entry_id": "081a88a0-95af-3d71-a494-40986238ea4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of discovering or finding; the act of finding out; discovery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db433f93-70d1-48ad-9044-ec7e66428cc6",
                                                "sense_id": "95b6afa1-ec69-3e22-976c-5cd4f3bca8b1",
                                                "text": "That judicial method which serveth best for the invention of truth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80f9b638-65d2-4211-9d41-8396eae8fa2c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9caf764c-3645-3a4d-bdfa-419ea2c50970",
                        "source_sense_id": "e06baadf-7edb-348c-855d-4154e93ad7c4",
                        "source_sense_description": "ontdekking, uitvinding",
                        "target_lang_word": "invention",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "invention",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d298112a-03f1-37c6-bb66-7025d50ae636",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Solution nouvelle, trouvée pour la première fois, inédite, et prouvée par un prototype qui fonctionne, d’un problème pratique, scientifique ou technique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f818ab0-db87-47dc-b0d2-443d8724cfed",
                                                "sense_id": "d298112a-03f1-37c6-bb66-7025d50ae636",
                                                "text": "Avant la paix d’Amiens, cet Anglais avait résolu le problème de couvrir le buste sans assommer le corps de cet affreux carrick qui finit aujourd’hui sur le dos des vieux cochers de fiacre ; mais comme les fines tailles sont en minorité, la mode du spencer pour homme n’eut en France qu’un succès passager, quoique ce fût une invention anglaise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c1d39a0-e8a3-37b3-9e12-2347fdbe12c2",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action d’inventer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e998d7f-a5f2-4879-9d27-a573d2974613",
                                                "sense_id": "4c1d39a0-e8a3-37b3-9e12-2347fdbe12c2",
                                                "text": "L’invention par sérendipité de l’hélice de bateau à pales en 1836 par William Pettit fut la conséquence d’un malencontreux hasard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1766c991-7b52-4adf-acfb-04c2801e5e1e",
                                                "sense_id": "4c1d39a0-e8a3-37b3-9e12-2347fdbe12c2",
                                                "text": "L’invention du mountain-biking (le VTT) par une bande d’ados du côté de San Francisco, en 1974 fut le fruit inattendu d’une conjonction unique de facteurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b264acf-030f-3a9d-94c2-a48554a846cf",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Solution technique qui peut faire l’objet d’une demande de brevet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a7de12b-d22e-3744-a14b-c26a41aaf68c",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fugue à deux voix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2eea8833-69ad-405e-b17c-b85e855e743a",
                                                "sense_id": "2a7de12b-d22e-3744-a14b-c26a41aaf68c",
                                                "text": "Les 15 inventions de J.S. Bach"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0d15f2f-b144-3e8e-a328-346f5f33ebb6",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Faculté cognitive et psychologique de trouver des solutions universelles à des problèmes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76b2663b-6384-4a6e-ab94-9a3b1e5faf3d",
                                                "sense_id": "a0d15f2f-b144-3e8e-a328-346f5f33ebb6",
                                                "text": "L’invention de l’australien Kia Silverbrook en fait le plus prolifiques inventeurs de tous les temps, 4 600 brevets vs 1 100 pour Edison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6fc92a6-54e7-35b8-8274-81cb0415036e",
                                        "entry_id": "0fddeec1-2ed1-3c53-a2a7-17f5dbe507dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Recherche et choix des arguments que l’on doit employer, des idées que le sujet fournit, dont on peut faire usage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rhetoric"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0585da8-38a5-4d55-9b69-9a1be022466f",
                                                "sense_id": "b6fc92a6-54e7-35b8-8274-81cb0415036e",
                                                "text": "Il nous reste deux livres des quatre que Cicéron avait écrits sur l’invention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
